    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41277" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιτεκμαίρομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>detect</i> a star <i>by means
				of,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζώνῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arat.
					229
				</span></i>
			 ; so <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κείνων</span> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κείνους</span>
