					Id.
					1038
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1129
			</span></i> (tm.) ; <i>infer, conjecture,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. οἷος..</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					142
				</span></i>
			.</div>
